{# =========================================================
   RoomHive — My Account › Wallet
   templates/user/wallet.html.twig

   REBUILT onto the shared account shell — same recipe as
   help / notifications / bookings / payments / messages / reviews:

     - Sidebar: shared partial templates/partials/sidebar.html.twig,
       highlight key 'wallet'. The inline <aside> + its ~110-line
       CSS block are gone (the partial owns them) — and with them
       the Saved Searches entry (removed from the sidebar
       everywhere; help is now the last entry).
     - Footer: shared partials/footer.html.twig added after </main>
       (= legacy user_footer.php).
     - Lucide: guarded loader (window.__rhNavbarLucide — never
       double-loads with the navbar's) replaces the plain CDN tag
       + upRefreshIcons().
     - Reveal: the kill-switch CSS is dropped -> the REAL legacy
       mechanism (.up-reveal waits for .in-view) + the 1.5s
       failsafe so the page can never render blank. (This page
       never had a reveal script — the kill-switch did all the
       work; now the balance card + both shell cards animate in
       like on every other account page.)
     - Collapse: same localStorage key (roomhive_sidebar_collapsed)
       + the updateTitles version (collapsed links get title
       tooltips instead of hidden labels).

   NAVBAR CLEARANCE + LAYOUT — page-local, bulletproof. This page
   has NO ub-page-head (it goes straight into the shell), so it
   uses the notifications/settings variant:
     - main.up-dashboard (higher specificity, always wins vs
       myaccount.css) carries the clearance as PADDING — margins
       can collapse, padding can never, so the shell cannot ride
       under the fixed navbar: padding: 110px 20px 70px,
       max-width: 1560px.
     - .up-dashboard .up-content { padding-top: 75px; } — the
       balance card + alerts join the 185px card line used by the
       notifications / settings / bookings pages.
     - .up-dashboard .up-sidebar { top: 110px; } — the sticky
       offset matches the shell's clearance line (the partial's
       default is 86px).

   Wallet content (1:1 with legacy wallet.php — nothing
   content-side changed):
   - top-up success / cancelled / error alerts (up-alert-*,
     restyled inline with the shell palette — legacy pulled
     these from myaccount.css)
   - navy honeycomb balance card + Top-ups/Spent/Refunds/Rewards
   - Add Money card: preset chips (100–5000), amount input,
     TOP UP submit → payment overlay (GCash number / card
     details) → POST /wallet with method + details. The
     /wallet/gcash checkout page is OUT of the flow now —
     confirming the number / card details IS the whole payment
     (simulated instant top-up — see NO REAL GCASH below)
   - Transaction History card: last 50 ledger movements with
     lucide icons, +/- amounts and balance-after trail — every
     row is clickable and opens its own receipt overlay

   Data comes from WalletController::index (user, wallet,
   total_topups, total_spent, total_refunds, total_rewards,
   txns [each enriched with label / type_class / icon / is_in],
   notif_count, csrf_wallet, topup_flag, topup_error).
   WalletController.php IS wired now — see INSTANT APPROVAL +
   RECEIPTS below for what changed server-side.

   PAYMENT CHOOSER OVERLAY (earlier revision):
   - The submit button is now a neutral amber "TOP UP" (was
     "TOP UP WITH GCASH" in GCash blue).
   - Submitting the form no longer posts straight away: it opens
     a modal overlay (#wlMethodModal) where you choose GCash or
     Banking Cards (Esc / X / backdrop click cancel it).
   - The choice is written into the new hidden "method" field
     (gcash | card) right before the real POST, together with
     the entered payment details — everything WalletController
     needs to credit the wallet instantly (no pending txn, no
     GCash page in between).
   - Native amount validation (required / min / max) still runs
     BEFORE the overlay opens; the overlay shows the entered
     amount as a live chip, locks body scroll while open, and
     traps Tab focus inside the dialog. If JS ever fails, the
     form just posts with method=gcash (legacy behaviour).

   TWO-STEP OVERLAY:
   - Step 1 "Choose how to pay": the GCash / Banking Cards tiles
     no longer post directly — each opens its own step.
   - GCash step: Philippine mobile number field (live-formats as
     0912 345 6789, or +639...), client-side validated, then
     TOP UP <amount> posts method=gcash + gcash_number.
   - Card step: name on card, card number (4-4-4-4 grouping,
     Luhn checksum, live Visa / Mastercard badge), MM/YY expiry
     (cannot be in the past), CVV (3-4 digits) — TOP UP <amount>
     posts method=card + card_name / card_number / card_expiry /
     card_cvv.
   - Back buttons (data-back) return to step 1; entered values
     survive the round trip. Esc / X / backdrop click cancel.
   - All collected values ride along as hidden mirror inputs
     inside #wlTopupForm (gcash_number, card_name, card_number,
     card_expiry, card_cvv) — WalletController can start reading
     and validating them whenever it gets pasted. Template-only;
     controller untouched.

   IN-SITE SETTLEMENT (this revision — the HTTP 404 at
   /wallet/gcash?ref=WH-... can never appear again): the confirm
   buttons no longer do a full-page submit. They POST the form in
   the background (fetch with redirect: "manual") while the
   overlay stays open, buttons disabled ("PROCESSING...").
     - HOTFIX (this build — "Top-up failed (HTTP 404)" was STILL
       happening, but never at /wallet/gcash): the fetch URL was
       read off the form's action DOM property. This form carries
       hidden inputs NAMED "action" and "method", and named form
       controls SHADOW the matching DOM properties — so that
       property handed back the <input> element itself, fetch
       stringified it to "[object HTMLInputElement]" and POSTed
       to a garbage relative URL. The URL now comes from
       getAttribute("action") — immune to the shadowing — with
       the Twig-rendered route as fallback, and the verb is
       hardcoded "POST" instead of being read off the form.
     - The legacy WalletController answers the top-up POST with a
       redirect to /wallet/gcash?ref=... (the old checkout page
       that was never ported — following that redirect WAS the
       404 the previous build showed). fetch() now NEVER follows
       the chain: every 3xx comes back as an opaque redirect
       (status 0, type "opaqueredirect") and /wallet/gcash is
       never requested, so the 404 cannot happen again. The
       bounce IS the acceptance, so the JS treats the top-up as
       PAID and returns to /wallet.
     - If the backend instead re-renders the wallet page with a
       topup_error alert (marker id #wlTopupErrorBanner), that
       message is shown inside the overlay — no navigation.
     - Any other non-2xx answer shows a generic error line.
     - On success a sessionStorage flag (wlTopupToast) makes the
       reloaded /wallet page pop a green "Top-up successful"
       toast bottom-right (#wlToast).
   - NO REAL GCASH: confirming the number (or the card details)
     IS the whole payment — no GCash app, no external checkout,
     nothing external. Both step notes say the checkout is
     simulated for now.
   - Optional companion file (no longer required by the overlay):
     src/Controller/WalletGcashFallbackController.php routes the
     legacy /wallet/gcash URL back to /wallet — only useful for
     old bookmarks, the currently-open 404 tab and JS-off
     submits. The settled overlay never needs it.

   INSTANT APPROVAL + RECEIPTS (this revision):
   - WalletController no longer parks top-ups as PENDING: the
     POST credits users.wallet_balance in the same request and
     writes the ledger row with payment_status='paid' + the real
     balance_after, then redirects to /wallet?topup=success
     (banner + green toast unchanged). No real GCash anywhere.
   - APPROVE-ON-SIGHT: pending top-up rows left by the old build
     are flipped to 'paid' on page load, credited once, and
     balance_after is backfilled newest-first — the PENDING rows
     from the old screenshots become APPROVED automatically.
   - Status pill: every row now wears its pill — paid/pending
     top-ups read APPROVED (green), failed reads FAILED (red),
     pending non-top-up movements keep PENDING (amber).
   - RECEIPTS: every history row is clickable (mouse, Enter,
     Space) and opens #wlReceiptModal — official-receipt panel
     with receipt no. (= ledger reference), type, date, paid
     via, GCash number when stored, description, signed amount
     and balance-after. Print prints ONLY the receipt
     (html.wl-print-receipt + @media print visibility switch).
     Esc / X / backdrop click / Done close it.
========================================================= #}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
        <title>My Wallet · RoomHive</title>

        <script>
            /* theme boot — before paint (same key as profile/payments) */
            (function () {
                try {
                    if (localStorage.getItem("roomhive_theme") === "dark") {
                        document.documentElement.classList.add("dark");
                        document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-theme", "dark");
                    }
                } catch (e) {}
            })();
            document.documentElement.classList.add("js");
        </script>

        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/style.css') }}">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/myaccount.css') }}">

        <style>
            :root {
                --rh-ink: #1c2a38;
                --rh-muted: #66788a;
                --rh-line: #e6ebf1;
                --rh-card: #ffffff;
                --rh-accent: #eda423;
                --rh-accent-deep: #d98c12;
                --rh-radius: 16px;
                --rh-green: #1fa971;
                --rh-green-bg: #e8f7ef;
                --rh-blue: #2f7de1;
                --rh-blue-bg: #e9f2fd;
            }

            body {
                background: #f3f5f9;
            }

            svg.lucide {
                display: inline-block;
                vertical-align: -0.18em;
                flex-shrink: 0;
            }

            /* =========================================================
                                                               NAVBAR CLEARANCE + LAYOUT — page-local, bulletproof
                                                               (no ub-page-head on this page — notifications/settings
                                                               variant). main.up-dashboard (higher specificity, always
                                                               wins vs myaccount.css) carries the clearance as PADDING
                                                               — margins can collapse, padding can never: padding:
                                                               110px 20px 70px, max-width: 1560px. The balance card
                                                               joins the 185px card line via the 75px content drop.
                                                            ========================================================== */
            main.up-dashboard {
                margin-top: 0;
                padding: 110px 20px 70px;
                max-width: 1560px;
            }

            /* the content column keeps its extra 75px drop below the
                                                               shell's 110px clearance (alerts + balance card land on
                                                               the same 185px line as the other account pages) */
            .up-dashboard .up-content {
                padding-top: 75px;
            }

            /* sticky offset matches the shell's clearance line — when
                                                               you scroll, the sidebar sticks at the same 110px line
                                                               instead of tucking under the navbar (the partial's
                                                               default is 86px) */
            .up-dashboard .up-sidebar {
                top: 110px;
            }

            /* sidebar markup + styles live in templates/partials/sidebar.html.twig */

            /* ================= alerts (up-alert-* — restyled inline,
                                                               legacy myaccount.css supplied these) ================= */
            .up-alert {
                border-radius: 12px;
                padding: 12px 16px;
                font-size: 13.5px;
                line-height: 1.5;
            }
            .up-alert p {
                margin: 0;
                font-weight: 600;
            }
            .up-alert svg {
                width: 16px;
                height: 16px;
                flex-shrink: 0;
                vertical-align: -3px;
                margin-right: 6px;
            }
            .up-alert-success {
                background: #e8f7ef;
                color: #14683e;
                border: 1px solid #bfe8d2;
            }
            .up-alert-error {
                background: #fceaea;
                color: #a1332e;
                border: 1px solid #f2c5c0;
            }

            /* ================= cards / two-col ================= */
            .up-two-col {
                display: grid;
                /* wallet ratio: narrow Add Money · wide History (legacy
                                                                   inline style grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.6fr) */
                grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.6fr);
                gap: 20px;
                align-items: start;
            }
            .up-card-head {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: space-between;
                gap: 10px;
                margin-bottom: 14px;
            }
            .up-card-head h3 {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 16px;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
            }

            /* =====================================================
                                                               WALLET — self-contained styles (carried over 1:1 from
                                                               legacy wallet.php's own <style> block; the var(--up-*),
                                                               fallbacks make these rules standalone)
                                                            ====================================================== */
            .wl-balance-card {
                position: relative;
                overflow: hidden;

                padding: 34px 36px;

                background:
                    radial-gradient(
                        600px 260px at 90% -30%,
                        rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.22),
                        transparent 60%
                    ),
                    linear-gradient(120deg, #1c2a38 0%, #24384d 60%, #1c2a38 100%);

                border-radius: 20px;
                color: #ffffff;

                box-shadow: 0 20px 44px rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.28);
            }

            .wl-balance-card::before {
                content: "";
                position: absolute;
                inset: 0;
                background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='28' height='49' viewBox='0 0 28 49' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='%23f6c04e' fill-opacity='0.06' fill-rule='nonzero'%3E%3Cpath d='M13.99 9.25l13 7.5v15l-13 7.5L1 31.75v-15l12.99-7.5zM3 17.9v12.7l10.99 6.34 11-6.35V17.9l-11-6.34L3 17.9zM0 15l12.98-7.5V0h-2v6.35L0 12.69v2.3zm0 18.5L12.98 41v8h-2v-6.85L0 35.81v-2.3zM15 0v7.5L27.99 15H28v-2.31h-.01L17 6.35V0h-2zm0 49v-8l12.99-7.5H28v2.31h-.01L17 42.15V49h-2z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E");
                background-size: 28px 49px;
                pointer-events: none;
            }

            .wl-balance-label {
                position: relative;
                z-index: 1;

                color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
                font-size: 11px;
                font-weight: 700;
                letter-spacing: 1px;
                text-transform: uppercase;
            }

            .wl-balance-amount {
                position: relative;
                z-index: 1;

                margin-top: 8px;

                font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 46px);
                font-weight: 800;
                letter-spacing: -1px;
                line-height: 1;
            }

            .wl-balance-amount .wl-peso {
                color: #f6c04e;
                margin-right: 6px;
            }

            .wl-balance-meta {
                position: relative;
                z-index: 1;

                margin-top: 12px;

                display: flex;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                gap: 8px 18px;

                color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
                font-size: 12px;
            }

            .wl-balance-meta strong {
                color: #ffffff;
            }

            /* Top-up card */
            .wl-topup-presets {
                display: flex;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                gap: 8px;

                margin-bottom: 14px;
            }

            .wl-preset {
                padding: 8px 14px;

                background: #ffffff;
                border: 1.5px solid #e3e7ec;
                border-radius: 10px;

                color: var(--up-navy, #1c2a38);

                font-family: inherit;
                font-size: 12.5px;
                font-weight: 700;

                cursor: pointer;

                transition:
                    border-color 0.15s ease,
                    background 0.15s ease,
                    color 0.15s ease;
            }

            .wl-preset:hover {
                border-color: #eda423;
                background: #fff8ec;
                color: #b07708;
            }

            .wl-preset.active {
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f6b93b, #eda423);
                border-color: transparent;
                color: #1c2a38;
            }

            .wl-amount-input {
                width: 100%;
                padding: 12px 14px;

                background: #fbfcfd;
                border: 1.5px solid #e3e7ec;
                border-radius: 10px;

                outline: none;

                color: var(--up-navy, #1c2a38);

                font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
                font-size: 16px;
                font-weight: 700;

                box-sizing: border-box;

                transition:
                    border-color 0.2s ease,
                    box-shadow 0.2s ease,
                    background 0.2s ease;
            }

            .wl-amount-input:focus {
                background: #ffffff;
                border-color: #eda423;
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.15);
            }

            /* Top-up submit button — method-neutral now: the payment
                                       method (GCash / Banking Cards) is chosen in the overlay
                                       that opens after clicking, so the button wears the
                                       RoomHive amber instead of GCash blue */
            .wl-topup-btn {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 10px;

                width: 100%;
                height: 50px;
                margin-top: 14px;

                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f6b93b, #eda423);
                border: none;
                border-radius: 12px;

                color: #1c2a38;

                font-family: inherit;
                font-size: 13.5px;
                font-weight: 800;
                letter-spacing: 0.5px;

                cursor: pointer;

                box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.35);

                transition:
                    transform 0.2s ease,
                    box-shadow 0.2s ease;
            }

            .wl-topup-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
                transform: translateY(-2px);
                box-shadow: 0 12px 26px rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.45);
            }

            .wl-topup-btn:disabled {
                opacity: 0.6;
                cursor: not-allowed;
            }

            .wl-topup-btn svg {
                width: 18px;
                height: 18px;
            }

            /* =====================================================
                                                               PAYMENT METHOD OVERLAY — opens when TOP UP is pressed;
                                                               pick GCash or Banking Cards. Fixed backdrop sits above
                                                               the navbar (z 1200), panel pops in, body scroll locks.
                                                            ====================================================== */
            .wl-modal-backdrop {
                position: fixed;
                inset: 0;
                z-index: 1200;

                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                padding: 20px;

                background: rgba(15, 23, 32, 0.55);
                -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(3px);
                backdrop-filter: blur(3px);

                animation: wl-fade-in 0.18s ease;
            }

            .wl-modal-backdrop[hidden] {
                display: none;
            }

            .wl-modal {
                position: relative;

                width: 100%;
                max-width: 420px;
                max-height: calc(100vh - 40px);
                overflow-y: auto;

                background: #ffffff;
                border-radius: 18px;
                padding: 26px 24px 22px;

                box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(15, 23, 32, 0.35);

                animation: wl-pop-up 0.22s ease;
            }

            .wl-modal h3 {
                margin: 0;

                color: var(--up-navy, #1c2a38);
                font-size: 18px;
                font-weight: 800;
            }

            .wl-modal-sub {
                margin: 6px 0 0;

                color: var(--up-text-muted, #6b7684);
                font-size: 12.5px;
                line-height: 1.5;
            }

            .wl-modal-amount {
                display: inline-block;
                margin-top: 10px;
                padding: 4px 12px;

                background: #fff8ec;
                border: 1px solid #f2dcae;
                border-radius: 999px;

                color: #b07708;
                font-size: 12px;
                font-weight: 800;
            }

            .wl-modal-amount[hidden] {
                display: none;
            }

            .wl-modal-close {
                position: absolute;
                top: 14px;
                right: 14px;

                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;

                width: 32px;
                height: 32px;

                background: #f3f5f9;
                border: none;
                border-radius: 10px;

                color: #66788a;

                cursor: pointer;

                transition:
                    background 0.15s ease,
                    color 0.15s ease;
            }

            .wl-modal-close:hover {
                background: #e8edf3;
                color: #1c2a38;
            }

            .wl-modal-close:focus-visible {
                outline: 2px solid #eda423;
                outline-offset: 2px;
            }

            .wl-modal-close svg {
                width: 16px;
                height: 16px;
            }

            .wl-pay-options {
                display: grid;
                gap: 10px;

                margin-top: 18px;
            }

            .wl-pay-tile {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 14px;

                width: 100%;
                padding: 14px 16px;

                background: #fbfcfd;
                border: 1.5px solid #e3e7ec;
                border-radius: 14px;

                color: inherit;
                text-align: left;
                font-family: inherit;

                cursor: pointer;

                transition:
                    border-color 0.15s ease,
                    background 0.15s ease,
                    transform 0.15s ease,
                    box-shadow 0.15s ease;
            }

            .wl-pay-tile:hover {
                border-color: #eda423;
                background: #fff8ec;
                transform: translateY(-1px);
                box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.08);
            }

            .wl-pay-tile:focus-visible {
                outline: 2px solid #eda423;
                outline-offset: 2px;
            }

            .wl-pay-ico {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                flex-shrink: 0;

                width: 42px;
                height: 42px;

                border-radius: 12px;

                color: #ffffff;
            }

            .wl-pay-ico svg {
                width: 20px;
                height: 20px;
            }

            .wl-ico-gcash {
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0075f6, #0057d4);
                box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(0, 87, 212, 0.3);
            }

            .wl-ico-card {
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #24384d, #1c2a38);
                box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.3);
            }

            .wl-pay-text {
                flex: 1;
                min-width: 0;
            }

            .wl-pay-text strong {
                display: block;

                color: var(--up-navy, #1c2a38);
                font-size: 14px;
                font-weight: 800;
            }

            .wl-pay-text span {
                display: block;
                margin-top: 2px;

                color: var(--up-text-muted, #6b7684);
                font-size: 11.5px;
                line-height: 1.45;
            }

            .wl-pay-arrow {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                flex-shrink: 0;

                color: #b8c2cf;
            }

            .wl-pay-arrow svg {
                width: 18px;
                height: 18px;
            }

            .wl-modal-note {
                margin: 16px 0 0;

                color: var(--up-text-muted, #6b7684);
                font-size: 11px;
                text-align: center;
            }

            /* Top-up result toast — pops bottom-right when the overlay
                                       JS returns to /wallet after a successful in-site top-up */
            .wl-toast {
                position: fixed;
                right: 20px;
                bottom: 20px;
                z-index: 1300;

                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 10px;

                max-width: calc(100vw - 40px);
                padding: 12px 18px;

                background: #1c2a38;
                border-radius: 12px;

                color: #ffffff;
                font-size: 13px;
                font-weight: 700;
                line-height: 1.4;

                box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(15, 23, 32, 0.35);

                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(14px);
                pointer-events: none;

                transition:
                    opacity 0.25s ease,
                    transform 0.25s ease;
            }

            .wl-toast.is-show {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }

            .wl-toast svg {
                width: 17px;
                height: 17px;
                flex-shrink: 0;

                color: #4ade80;
            }

            html.dark .wl-toast {
                background: #24384d;
                box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            }

            @media (max-width: 480px) {
                .wl-toast {
                    right: 12px;
                    bottom: 12px;
                }
            }

            @keyframes wl-fade-in {
                from {
                    opacity: 0;
                }
                to {
                    opacity: 1;
                }
            }

            @keyframes wl-pop-up {
                from {
                    opacity: 0;
                    transform: translateY(14px) scale(0.97);
                }
                to {
                    opacity: 1;
                    transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
                }
            }

            @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
                .wl-modal-backdrop,
                .wl-modal {
                    animation: none;
                }
                .wl-topup-btn,
                .wl-pay-tile {
                    transition: none;
                }
            }

            /* =====================================================
                                                               OVERLAY STEPS — step 1 is the chooser; the GCash and
                                                               Card panels open on tile click. Back buttons return
                                                               to step 1; entered values survive the round trip.
                                                            ====================================================== */
            .wl-step[hidden] {
                display: none;
            }

            .wl-modal-back {
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 4px;

                margin: 0 0 4px;
                padding: 6px 10px 6px 6px;

                background: transparent;
                border: none;
                border-radius: 8px;

                color: var(--up-text-muted, #6b7684);

                font-family: inherit;
                font-size: 11.5px;
                font-weight: 700;
                letter-spacing: 0.3px;

                cursor: pointer;

                transition:
                    background 0.15s ease,
                    color 0.15s ease;
            }

            .wl-modal-back:hover {
                background: #f3f5f9;
                color: #1c2a38;
            }

            .wl-modal-back:focus-visible {
                outline: 2px solid #eda423;
                outline-offset: 2px;
            }

            .wl-modal-back svg {
                width: 14px;
                height: 14px;
            }

            .wl-step-head {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 14px;

                margin-top: 12px;

                text-align: left;
            }

            .wl-step-head h3 {
                margin: 0;

                font-size: 17px;
            }

            .wl-step-head p {
                margin: 3px 0 0;

                color: var(--up-text-muted, #6b7684);
                font-size: 12px;
                line-height: 1.45;
            }

            .wl-field {
                margin-top: 14px;

                text-align: left;
            }

            .wl-field label {
                display: block;
                margin-bottom: 6px;

                color: var(--up-text-muted, #6b7684);
                font-size: 11px;
                font-weight: 800;
                letter-spacing: 0.5px;
                text-transform: uppercase;
            }

            .wl-input {
                width: 100%;
                padding: 12px 14px;

                background: #fbfcfd;
                border: 1.5px solid #e3e7ec;
                border-radius: 10px;

                outline: none;

                color: var(--up-navy, #1c2a38);

                font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
                font-size: 14.5px;
                font-weight: 700;

                box-sizing: border-box;

                transition:
                    border-color 0.2s ease,
                    box-shadow 0.2s ease,
                    background 0.2s ease;
            }

            .wl-input:focus {
                background: #ffffff;
                border-color: #eda423;
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.15);
            }

            .wl-input.wl-input-invalid,
            .wl-input.wl-input-invalid:focus {
                background: #fff5f5;
                border-color: #e5484d;
                box-shadow: none;
            }

            .wl-input-wrap {
                position: relative;
            }

            .wl-card-brand {
                position: absolute;
                top: 50%;
                right: 12px;

                transform: translateY(-50%);

                padding: 2px 8px;

                background: #e9f2fd;
                border-radius: 6px;

                color: #2f7de1;
                font-size: 10px;
                font-weight: 800;
                letter-spacing: 0.5px;
                text-transform: uppercase;

                pointer-events: none;
            }

            .wl-card-brand[hidden] {
                display: none;
            }

            .wl-field-error {
                display: flex;
                align-items: flex-start;
                gap: 6px;

                margin: 6px 0 0;

                color: #c5343a;
                font-size: 11.5px;
                font-weight: 600;
                line-height: 1.4;

                text-align: left;
            }

            .wl-field-error svg {
                width: 13px;
                height: 13px;
                flex: 0 0 auto;
                margin-top: 1px;
            }

            .wl-field-error[hidden] {
                display: none;
            }

            .wl-field-hint {
                margin: 6px 0 0;

                color: var(--up-text-muted, #6b7684);
                font-size: 11px;
                line-height: 1.45;

                text-align: left;
            }

            .wl-row-2 {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
                gap: 12px;
            }

            .wl-step .wl-topup-btn {
                margin-top: 18px;
            }

            .wl-limits-note {
                margin: 10px 0 0;

                color: var(--up-text-muted, #6b7684);
                font-size: 11.5px;
                text-align: center;
            }

            /* Stats row */
            .wl-stats {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
                gap: 14px;
            }

            .wl-stat {
                background: #ffffff;
                border: 1px solid var(--up-border, rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.08));
                border-radius: 14px;
                padding: 16px 18px;

                box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.05);
            }

            .wl-stat span {
                display: block;

                color: var(--up-text-muted, #6b7684);
                font-size: 10.5px;
                font-weight: 700;
                letter-spacing: 0.6px;
                text-transform: uppercase;
            }

            .wl-stat strong {
                display: block;
                margin-top: 5px;

                color: var(--up-navy, #1c2a38);
                font-size: 19px;
                font-weight: 800;
            }

            /* History */
            .wl-txn {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 14px;

                padding: 13px 4px;
                border-bottom: 1px solid var(--up-border, rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.08));
            }

            .wl-txn:last-child {
                border-bottom: none;
            }

            .wl-txn-ico {
                width: 40px;
                height: 40px;
                flex-shrink: 0;

                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;

                border-radius: 12px;
            }

            .wl-txn-ico svg {
                width: 18px;
                height: 18px;
            }

            .wt-type-topup .wl-txn-ico {
                background: #e8f8f1;
                color: #1e7a3d;
            }

            .wt-type-spend .wl-txn-ico {
                background: #fff1dc;
                color: #b07708;
            }

            .wt-type-refund .wl-txn-ico {
                background: #e9f0fa;
                color: #33517e;
            }

            .wt-type-reward .wl-txn-ico {
                background: #f3e8fa;
                color: #7a4bb0;
            }

            .wl-txn-info {
                flex: 1;
                min-width: 0;
            }

            .wl-txn-info strong {
                display: block;

                color: var(--up-navy, #1c2a38);
                font-size: 13.5px;
                font-weight: 700;

                white-space: nowrap;
                overflow: hidden;
                text-overflow: ellipsis;
            }

            .wl-txn-info span {
                display: block;
                margin-top: 2px;

                color: var(--up-text-muted, #6b7684);
                font-size: 11.5px;
            }

            .wl-txn-amt {
                text-align: right;
                flex-shrink: 0;
            }

            .wl-txn-amt strong {
                display: block;

                font-size: 14.5px;
                font-weight: 800;
            }

            .wl-amt-in {
                color: #1e7a3d;
            }

            .wl-amt-out {
                color: #a1332e;
            }

            .wl-txn-amt span {
                display: block;
                margin-top: 2px;

                color: var(--up-text-muted, #6b7684);
                font-size: 10.5px;
            }

            .wl-status-pill {
                display: inline-block;
                margin-top: 3px;

                padding: 2px 8px;

                border-radius: 999px;

                font-size: 9.5px;
                font-weight: 800;
                letter-spacing: 0.4px;
            }

            .wl-st-paid {
                background: #e8f8f1;
                color: #1fa971;
            }

            .wl-st-pending {
                background: #fff1dc;
                color: #b07708;
            }

            .wl-st-failed {
                background: #fceaea;
                color: #a1332e;
            }

            .wl-empty {
                text-align: center;
                padding: 30px 12px;
                color: var(--up-text-muted, #6b7684);
            }

            .wl-empty strong {
                display: block;
                margin-bottom: 4px;

                color: var(--up-navy, #1c2a38);
                font-size: 14px;
                font-weight: 700;
            }

            .wl-empty-ico {
                display: block;
                width: 34px;
                height: 34px;
                margin: 0 auto 8px;
                color: #c3c9d2;
            }

            /* Sandbox notice (kept from legacy CSS; unused for now —
                                                               the checkout is simulated inside the overlay) */
            .wl-sandbox-note {
                display: flex;
                align-items: flex-start;
                gap: 10px;

                padding: 12px 14px;

                background: #f3e8fa;
                border: 1px dashed rgba(122, 75, 176, 0.4);
                border-radius: 12px;

                color: #5c3a85;
                font-size: 12px;
                line-height: 1.55;
            }

            /* =====================================================
                                       CLICKABLE HISTORY + RECEIPT OVERLAY — every ledger
                                       row opens #wlReceiptModal (mouse / Enter / Space);
                                       Print prints only the receipt panel.
                                       ====================================================== */
            .wl-history-hint {
                margin: -6px 0 10px;

                color: var(--up-text-muted, #6b7684);
                font-size: 11.5px;
            }

            .wl-txn[role="button"] {
                cursor: pointer;
                border-radius: 10px;

                transition: background 0.15s ease;
            }

            .wl-txn[role="button"]:hover {
                background: rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.045);
            }

            .wl-txn[role="button"]:focus-visible {
                outline: 2px solid #eda423;
                outline-offset: -2px;
            }

            .wl-txn-go {
                flex-shrink: 0;

                color: #c3c9d2;

                transition:
                    color 0.15s ease,
                    transform 0.15s ease;
            }

            .wl-txn-go svg {
                width: 16px;
                height: 16px;
            }

            .wl-txn[role="button"]:hover .wl-txn-go {
                color: #b07708;
                transform: translateX(2px);
            }

            .wl-receipt {
                max-width: 350px;

                text-align: center;
            }

            .wl-receipt-brand {
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 6px;

                color: #b07708;
                font-size: 11.5px;
                font-weight: 800;
                letter-spacing: 1.6px;
                text-transform: uppercase;
            }

            .wl-receipt-brand svg {
                width: 14px;
                height: 14px;
            }

            .wl-receipt h3 {
                margin-top: 8px;
            }

            .wl-receipt-sub {
                margin: 4px 0 0;

                color: var(--up-text-muted, #6b7684);
                font-size: 11.5px;
            }

            .wl-receipt .wl-status-pill {
                margin-top: 14px;
                padding: 3px 12px;

                font-size: 10px;
            }

            .wl-receipt-amount {
                margin-top: 8px;

                font-size: 30px;
                font-weight: 800;
                letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            }

            .wl-receipt-rows {
                margin: 16px 0 0;
                padding-top: 4px;

                border-top: 1px dashed rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.2);

                text-align: left;
            }

            .wl-receipt-rows > div {
                display: flex;
                align-items: baseline;
                justify-content: space-between;
                gap: 12px;

                padding: 7px 0;

                border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.1);
            }

            .wl-receipt-rows dt {
                flex-shrink: 0;

                color: var(--up-text-muted, #6b7684);
                font-size: 11.5px;
                font-weight: 600;
            }

            .wl-receipt-rows dd {
                margin: 0;

                color: var(--up-navy, #1c2a38);
                font-size: 12.5px;
                font-weight: 700;

                text-align: right;
                word-break: break-word;
            }

            .wl-receipt-rows .wl-receipt-total dd {
                font-size: 14px;
                font-weight: 800;
            }

            .wl-receipt-note {
                margin: 14px 0 0;

                color: var(--up-text-muted, #6b7684);
                font-size: 10.5px;
                line-height: 1.5;
            }

            .wl-receipt-actions {
                display: flex;
                gap: 10px;
                margin-top: 16px;
            }

            .wl-receipt-actions .wl-topup-btn {
                flex: 1;
                width: auto;
                margin-top: 0;
            }

            .wl-receipt-actions .wl-topup-btn:focus-visible {
                outline: 2px solid #1c2a38;
                outline-offset: 2px;
            }

            .wl-receipt-btn {
                flex: 1;

                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 7px;

                padding: 11px 14px;

                background: #ffffff;
                border: 1.5px solid rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.16);
                border-radius: 12px;

                color: var(--up-navy, #1c2a38);
                font-family: inherit;
                font-size: 13px;
                font-weight: 800;

                cursor: pointer;

                transition:
                    background 0.15s ease,
                    border-color 0.15s ease;
            }

            .wl-receipt-btn:hover {
                background: #f3f5f9;
                border-color: rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.3);
            }

            .wl-receipt-btn:focus-visible {
                outline: 2px solid #eda423;
                outline-offset: 2px;
            }

            .wl-receipt-btn svg {
                width: 15px;
                height: 15px;
            }

            /* ================= dark mode (html.dark — same mechanism
                                                               as payments; legacy checked data-theme) ================= */
            html.dark body {
                background: #141c26;
            }
            html.dark .up-card {
                background: #1e2a38;
                border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
                box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
            }
            html.dark .up-card-head h3 {
                color: #e8eef5;
            }
            html.dark .wl-topup-card,
            html.dark .wl-history-card,
            html.dark .wl-stat {
                background: #1a222b;
                border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
                box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
            }
            html.dark .wl-preset {
                background: #1a222b;
                border-color: rgba(232, 236, 241, 0.14);
                color: #e8ecf1;
            }
            html.dark .wl-preset.active {
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f6b93b, #eda423);
                border-color: transparent;
                color: #1c2a38;
            }
            html.dark .wl-amount-input {
                background: #1a222b;
                border-color: rgba(232, 236, 241, 0.14);
                color: #e8ecf1;
            }
            html.dark .wl-modal {
                background: #1e2a38;
                box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
            }
            html.dark .wl-modal h3 {
                color: #e8eef5;
            }
            html.dark .wl-modal-sub,
            html.dark .wl-pay-text span,
            html.dark .wl-modal-note {
                color: #a9b8c8;
            }
            html.dark .wl-modal-close {
                background: #243444;
                color: #a9b8c8;
            }
            html.dark .wl-modal-close:hover {
                background: #2d4054;
                color: #e8eef5;
            }
            html.dark .wl-modal-amount {
                background: rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.12);
                border-color: rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.3);
                color: #f6c04e;
            }
            html.dark .wl-pay-tile {
                background: #1a222b;
                border-color: rgba(232, 236, 241, 0.14);
            }
            html.dark .wl-pay-tile:hover {
                background: #223041;
                border-color: #eda423;
            }
            html.dark .wl-modal-back:hover {
                background: #243444;
                color: #e8eef5;
            }
            html.dark .wl-step-head p {
                color: #a9b8c8;
            }
            html.dark .wl-field label {
                color: #a9b8c8;
            }
            html.dark .wl-input {
                background: #1a222b;
                border-color: rgba(232, 236, 241, 0.14);
                color: #e8ecf1;
            }
            html.dark .wl-input:focus {
                background: #1a222b;
                border-color: #eda423;
            }
            html.dark .wl-input.wl-input-invalid,
            html.dark .wl-input.wl-input-invalid:focus {
                background: #2a1b1e;
                border-color: #e5484d;
            }
            html.dark .wl-field-error {
                color: #ff8589;
            }
            html.dark .wl-field-hint {
                color: #a9b8c8;
            }
            html.dark .wl-card-brand {
                background: rgba(47, 125, 225, 0.18);
                color: #7db1f5;
            }
            html.dark .wl-txn[role="button"]:hover {
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);
            }
            html.dark .wl-txn-go {
                color: #4a5b6d;
            }
            html.dark .wl-txn[role="button"]:hover .wl-txn-go {
                color: #f6c04e;
            }
            html.dark .wl-history-hint,
            html.dark .wl-receipt-sub,
            html.dark .wl-receipt-note {
                color: #a9b8c8;
            }
            html.dark .wl-receipt-rows {
                border-top-color: rgba(232, 236, 241, 0.18);
            }
            html.dark .wl-receipt-rows > div {
                border-bottom-color: rgba(232, 236, 241, 0.09);
            }
            html.dark .wl-receipt-rows dt {
                color: #a9b8c8;
            }
            html.dark .wl-receipt-rows dd {
                color: #e8eef5;
            }
            html.dark .wl-receipt-btn {
                background: #1a222b;
                border-color: rgba(232, 236, 241, 0.16);
                color: #e8eef5;
            }
            html.dark .wl-receipt-btn:hover {
                background: #243444;
            }
            html.dark .wl-txn {
                border-color: rgba(232, 236, 241, 0.1);
            }
            html.dark .wl-txn-info strong,
            html.dark .wl-stat strong,
            html.dark .wl-empty strong {
                color: #e8eef5;
            }
            html.dark .wl-txn-info span,
            html.dark .wl-txn-amt span,
            html.dark .wl-empty,
            html.dark .wl-limits-note {
                color: #a9b8c8;
            }

            /* ================= responsive =================
                                                               (860px sidebar rules live in the shared partial) */
            @media (max-width: 980px) {
                .up-two-col {
                    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                }
            }
            @media (max-width: 900px) {
                .wl-stats {
                    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
                }
            }
            @media (max-width: 480px) {
                .wl-stats {
                    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                }
                .up-card {
                    padding: 16px;
                }
                .wl-modal {
                    padding: 20px 16px;
                }
                .wl-receipt-actions {
                    flex-direction: column;
                }
            }

            /* ================= print — only the open receipt =================
                                       The Print button tags <html> with .wl-print-receipt, so a
                                       normal Ctrl+P of the page is untouched. */
            @media print {
                html.wl-print-receipt body * {
                    visibility: hidden !important;
                }
                html.wl-print-receipt #wlReceiptModal,
                html.wl-print-receipt #wlReceiptModal * {
                    visibility: visible !important;
                }
                html.wl-print-receipt #wlReceiptModal {
                    position: absolute !important;
                    inset: 0 0 auto 0 !important;
                    padding: 0 !important;
                    background: #ffffff !important;
                    -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;
                    backdrop-filter: none !important;
                    animation: none !important;
                }
                html.wl-print-receipt #wlReceiptModal .wl-modal {
                    max-width: 100% !important;
                    max-height: none !important;
                    overflow: visible !important;
                    box-shadow: none !important;
                    animation: none !important;
                    border-radius: 0 !important;
                    padding: 10mm 8mm !important;
                }
                html.wl-print-receipt #wlReceiptClose,
                html.wl-print-receipt .wl-receipt-actions {
                    display: none !important;
                }
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>

        {{ include('partials/navbar.html.twig', {
            is_logged_in: true,
            is_host: is_host ?? false,
            nav_avatar: user.avatar_path ?? null,
            notification_count: notif_count ?? 0,
            current_page: 'wallet'
        }) }}

        <main class="up-dashboard">

            <!-- ==================================================
                 SIDEBAR — shared partial (templates/partials/sidebar.html.twig)
                 highlight = active_sidebar key · collapse JS stays on this page
            =================================================== -->
            {% include 'partials/sidebar.html.twig' with { active_sidebar: 'wallet' } %}

            <div class="up-content">

                {% if topup_flag == 'success' %}
                    <section class="up-alert up-alert-success">
                        <p><i data-lucide="circle-check"></i> Top-up successful! Your wallet has been credited.</p>
                    </section>
                {% endif %}

                {% if topup_flag == 'cancelled' %}
                    <section class="up-alert up-alert-error">
                        <p><i data-lucide="circle-x"></i> The GCash top-up was not completed. No money was taken.</p>
                    </section>
                {% endif %}

                {% if topup_error %}
                    <section class="up-alert up-alert-error" id="wlTopupErrorBanner">
                        <p><i data-lucide="circle-x"></i>{{ topup_error }}</p>
                    </section>
                {% endif %}

                <!-- BALANCE CARD -->
                <div class="wl-balance-card up-reveal">

                    <span class="wl-balance-label">RoomHive Wallet Balance</span>

                    <div class="wl-balance-amount">
                        <span class="wl-peso">&#8369;</span>{{ wallet|number_format(2) }}
                    </div>

                    <div class="wl-balance-meta">
                        <span>Top-ups: <strong>&#8369;{{ total_topups|number_format(2) }}</strong></span>
                        <span>Spent: <strong>&#8369;{{ total_spent|number_format(2) }}</strong></span>
                        <span>Refunds: <strong>&#8369;{{ total_refunds|number_format(2) }}</strong></span>
                        <span>Rewards: <strong>&#8369;{{ total_rewards|number_format(2) }}</strong></span>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="up-two-col">

                    <!-- TOP-UP CARD -->
                    <div class="up-card up-reveal wl-topup-card">

                        <div class="up-card-head">
                            <h3>Add Money</h3>
                        </div>

                        <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_wallet') }}" id="wlTopupForm">
                            <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{ csrf_wallet }}">
                            <input type="hidden" name="action" value="topup">
                            <input type="hidden" name="method" id="wlMethod" value="gcash">
                            <input type="hidden" name="gcash_number" id="wlGcashNumberField" value="">
                            <input type="hidden" name="card_name" id="wlCardNameField" value="">
                            <input type="hidden" name="card_number" id="wlCardNumberField" value="">
                            <input type="hidden" name="card_expiry" id="wlCardExpiryField" value="">
